OL,3,GNEWSAStakes raised as Grand Slam of
OL,4,ADarts begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people are expected to
OL,7,Fdescend on a Wolverhampton sports
OL,8,Fcentre over the next nine days as the
OL,9,FGrand Slam of Darts returns to the
OL,10,Fcity.
OL,12,FIt is one of the sport's major
OL,13,Ftournaments and is taking place at WV
OL,14,FActive Aldersley until 22 November.
OL,16,FThe competition is bigger than ever
OL,17,Fthis year with 48 players stepping up
OL,18,Fto the oche compared to the previous
OL,19,F32. Meanwhile the total prize fund has
OL,20,Fincreased from #650,000 to #1m.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
